      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk my doctor is super busy and honestly i feel like i know my body better than him lol. it's just magnesium, it's a natural mineral right? even people with kidney issues take it sometimes. i just really need to sleep. if i did go up to like 1200mg, i doubt it would do anything crazy, right? it's not like a prescription drug or anything.",
